  "bio": "Renowned for his meticulous Japanese and black & gray tattoo artistry, Lorenzo Arkadia Cappellano operates with peerless professionalism. Based in the artistic hub of Florence, Italy, Lorenzo splits his time between Eclipse Tattoo Studio in Certaldo and XTC Studio in Perugia, ensuring a premier experience in both craftsmanship and service. Clients seeking his expertise find themselves entrusting their skin to an artist synonymous with precision and dedication.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Florence, Tuscany, Italy\n\nArkadia Tattoo Studio  \nvia enrico guido bocci 129\nFirenze, Italy\nGuest c/o @eclipse_tattoo_studio \nGuest c/o @xtcstudio",
